<title>USA: CEO holds 5.3 pct WTD Industries preferred.</title>
<headline>CEO holds 5.3 pct WTD Industries preferred.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bruce Engel, chief executive of WTD Industries Inc, said Thursday he holds 14,250 series A preferred shares of the company, representing 5.3 percent of the class outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Engel said he paid $427,000 for the stake and holds it for investment purposes.</p>
